nt\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CRUSADERS_MANTLE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCRUSADERS_MANTLE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCRUSADERS_MANTLE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 5</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Crusader.27s_Mantle\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Crusader's_Mantle\">Sources of Crusader's Mantle</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Crusader's Mantle Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crusader's Mantle Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Crusader's Mantle Aura (Condition)\">Crusader's Mantle Aura</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>CRUSADERS_MANTLE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Crusader's_Mantle\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crusader%27s_Mantle_(Condition)\" title=\"Crusader's Mantle (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crusader's Mantle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Crusader's Mantle</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Near a paladin's holy aura. Weapon attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Crusader's_Mantle_Aura\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Crusader's Mantle Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crusader's Mantle Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Crusader%27s_Mantle_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Crusader's Mantle Aura (Condition)\">Crusader's Mantle Aura</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Emitting a holy aura. You and your nearby allies' weapon attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=